# Single source of truth for env vars. `op inject` renders this to .env;
# 1Password holds the field values (vault "SRE Team", item e2ai).
#
# base -> .env | [staging] -> .env.staging | [<user>] -> .env.<user>.local
# Blocks list only their own vars. Overriding happens at runtime: the Tiltfile
# and config loader source .env, then .env.$ENV (staging), then
# .env.$(whoami).local.
#
# Line syntax (house pattern, mirrors incidents-admin):
#   KEY=value                          plain value
#   KEY="op://vault/item/field"        1Password field, fetched by op inject

# GitHub app integration (webhook ingest INGE-01, PR comments REPT-02)
GITHUB_TOKEN="op://SRE Team/e2ai/github_pat"
WEBHOOK_SECRET="op://SRE Team/e2ai/github_webhook_secret"

# ===== blocks hold plain variable overrides only; secrets come from 1Password =====
